OL,3,GNEWSACall for lower speed limit on
OL,4,A'terrifying' road
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents living alongside a
OL,7,F"terrifying" road in Derbyshire have
OL,8,Fcalled for the speed limit to be cut in
OL,9,Fa bid to reduce the number of crashes.
OL,11,FA 30mph (48km/h) limit is currently in
OL,12,Fplace on the A6 Buxton Road, Bakewell,
OL,13,Fbut people living near the stretch have
OL,14,Fsaid cars are often seen travelling
OL,15,Fover the limit.
OL,17,FDiane Hawksworth, who has lived in
OL,18,FBuxton Road since 1973, said: "As you
OL,19,Fwalk down the street as a pedestrian
OL,20,Fand something is coming thundering
OL,21,Ftowards you and it's doing well over
OL,22,F30, it's terrifying."
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
