OL,3,GNEWSACall for lower speed limit on
OL,4,A'terrifying' road
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerbyshire County Council said road
OL,7,Fsafety was "one of its top priorities
OL,8,Fand it always welcomes the opportunity
OL,9,Fto listen to local residents about any
OL,10,Fissues they may have".
